            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ne Aruni alengila mu Liiema lie kumuse, mala afuule chingubo che katani nicho aafwara ne engila Abuundu Atakatifu, mala achilekhe mu bwenomwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne alesiinga Abuundu Atakatifu, mala afware chingubo chewe. Namalile ario alarura enje ache aane siianwa sie khukhwosia khurusiao bubwoni bwewe omwene ne bwe babaandu bewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloselia khu alutare kiminawa kie sisiaayo khulwe siianwa sirusiao bubwoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu otimaanie embusi aayiila mu sichiimi khu Asaseli, akhoya asiinge chingubo chewe, mala esiinge, nio engile mu kambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.13.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Baeb. 13.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Euunwa ne mbusi birumikhirwe khulwe siianwa sirusiao bubwoni, nibio kamalasile kabio kareerwa Abuundu Atakatifu khurusiao bubwoni, bilasutwa birusibwe enje we kambi. Kamasielo, chinyama ne kamasisie kabio bilosibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesi yesi obiosia akhakobola mu kambi tawe, akhoya asiinge chingubo chewe ne khukhwesiinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khukhebulila Endaalo eye khurusiao bubwoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
